<title>Pakistan and Afghanistan: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/afghanistan-pakistan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-afghanistan-pakistan-2026-11-09T06:56:58.233Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 06:56:58 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Iran is facing increased pressure as a task force moves to cut its transport of advanced weapons and the military expands a naval blockade to restrict Iranian land commerce. In Pakistan, security forces killed infiltrators in Upper Kurram and arrested Afghan Taliban members in Khyber Pakhtunkhwa, while an IED killed a bomb-disposal officer in Upper South Waziristan. A high-voltage cable fell on a house in Bahawalnagar, killing three members of the same family, and a bus-truck collision on the Hazara Motorway killed eight and injured thirty. The conflict still accounts for 1,794 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxOSjhhZzlJeHBXWDRBRzY4SjB3eF8wUlRWS25YOGF4S0ZfemxqMm5nQmJhemhQXzNJcVdCVF9mcDQwX21xSnRmZHpVcWRJMmlLX1lvN2xLaFNFeXVSbHctbHVyQnZNZVE1ZkZLVElWeGVacmdmV3ZicDEwUzYxRHZENFVFenMyMU1NbVJmOVRGX0R0MTU5bkVnV3p2cjBUWjJkbjRLLWpaNXhUanFMS25uVjBleU_SAboBQVVfeXFMTkd1ZjRpcThWQ0ROQXdTSGoyOFVpZlplY25TbWhOOW55a2lablJVVE1rWGF0QVNndzBZanVzY3VfTEdpYlo2bktMWEV3MzFhN21qRjNTUF9oUjRSZHFLb2hJWTBvRWZFTmlfQ29Gc256cFJpUkhDOVhmd0dScVJ4TUhwVjN4UTB0MF9VWXprNGlvQkMxa0NJWThuakMyUjZ4R0RvSnZnLV9wTnJzYkdfeFhLVjNSZ1J5Mzln?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiyAFBVV95cUxPVEJFcHotOXo2elMzQi10RUQ3NVBVRGhxZ20wMEw2Wm1zQ01jbXV4V0dwbnJwSjVZNFdSODFxRlZtVExkN0hsaTFwUFVIamkyS19GT3NrMkw5ZVRFZGRjWjZXM296bTRLUlpnNGxFeERqV0xORVRMdHpyTnY2S2JtZWp5blhaS0FIa01UMnlSWk9GTW9oOGh6Mlh5blNPTkdkdnd2d21kSEJDbC13V3U1XzFvcV9EQXVGVTdPWXRiUmotUjhVbHlULQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE95akRYeFVaZDJVZk1zRzJJckQtVmlmQm91VXBDWE9jT2hpVkFFbF8tRmEzQ3BVQVFnSmdLUk9oZkFXQVgwYThxbg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3l